  "details": "Adjusting Quality Preset along with Level of Detail or Shadows in the Graphics settings can lead to behavior where the Level of Detail or Shadows settings are reversed.\n\nIf one of the options such as Level of Detail is toggled, and the Quality Preset is changed, then for example, the option will show \"Low\" but is actually applying settings for High quality Level of Detail.",
